# Deploy VPS (backend)

## Scope
- **VPS**: `scripts/deploy.sh` → PM2 `crypto-api` + `crypto-worker`
- **Vercel**: frontend — push git only; set `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`

## Deploy command
```bash
~/deploy.sh
# DEPLOY_DB_PUSH=1 ~/deploy.sh   # schema change
# DEPLOY_SKIP_PULL=1 ~/deploy.sh # local build only
```

## Verify
- `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:3000/health` → 200
- `pm2 status` both apps online
- `docs/deployment.md`, `docs/v3-operations.md`

## Do not
- Run `pm2 logs` without `--nostream` in scripts (blocks forever)
- Flush logs every deploy unless debugging
- Deploy frontend on VPS unless explicitly requested
